{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision platformer, where you fly and collect stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can expect if you buy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >68+1 solo levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-5 hours of gameplay - every level takes 1-2 minutes if you don't die. But you will...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty, a fair difficulty curve was the goal, sometimes the game can be hard, sorry for that...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer shooting - a friendly fight with your people never hurts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer time trial - speedrunning the levels online (Trackmania style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All handmade graphics and sound - no AI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In single player mode the level difficulty increases slowly, giving plenty of time to enjoy and learn the challenging mechanics of flying between the platforms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can go one step further and aim for speed! This game is especially designed for speedrunning, an homage to the style was deeply my intention. Playing against your own time, or against the Global Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Challenge each other in online TimeTrials. Playing on the same level racing for the best time. Highly inspired by TrackMania Nations. A very fun mode with a high pressure sharp skill challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d73797949ea8a9ba491cb574120046de.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d73797949ea8a9ba491cb574120046de.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d73797949ea8a9ba491cb574120046de.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/cde291775405b38cc52166695d264a15.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/cde291775405b38cc52166695d264a15.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/cde291775405b38cc52166695d264a15.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Let's Kill each other! Online, high speed, fast paced, tactical good old shooting! Head-On: The Ultimate Gravity Shooter is considered the predecessor of this game. Try that online was the ultimate goal! Hope you enjoy that mode, it is my favourite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/75ac3b30a00023ea7d58aa8e0cb42524.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/75ac3b30a00023ea7d58aa8e0cb42524.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/75ac3b30a00023ea7d58aa8e0cb42524.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/c3377f00d7d39d7405393e3e10e8e22b.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/c3377f00d7d39d7405393e3e10e8e22b.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/c3377f00d7d39d7405393e3e10e8e22b.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d134d9c90385a8f6c7913272281f9d14.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d134d9c90385a8f6c7913272281f9d14.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/d134d9c90385a8f6c7913272281f9d14.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose the skin of your ship, choose your trail, your weapons! Fine tune the engine, even the nitty-gritty details can be set to your taste. To perform on the highest level, you might need those.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/86caa05e4982735fdb6cd597cd2164a176d05c99.jpg"},{"name":"Entered Solo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/8b448829e9854964159e95a4ab4de0c9872da0ee.jpg"},{"name":"Double Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/f9f7f0956f78c19cc2d245225fb157a7758ba159.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/460b1b336e6220ae64b859d4ff5b341db7ecc413.jpg"},{"name":"Ultra Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/2aa54c76fcb92796e187f89b90f557e6fa5dfc2d.jpg"},{"name":"Overclock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/70db0555c8963dbdd3bc905125e396a67c600812.jpg"},{"name":"Top GUN!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/8604da12c5128f336b8aed294db5bc50a84f3468.jpg"},{"name":"10th Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/201dd09760d5bb93261aec7b6f9d708a21853c49.jpg"},{"name":"Shard of Vojbas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/2f580c8dc0543b025319e276c0d04369315f30df.jpg"},{"name":"Mega Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989960/5a87cd66f5a0987cb5bddb35247423daff98c9b8.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1989960?t=1763058028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1989960?t=1763058028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/3345c54f7d8cb0c165683bb20612229344d7b0ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763058028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/3345c54f7d8cb0c165683bb20612229344d7b0ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763058028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2525030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/df3f7e9bab01e3125c5fca71aa642f60.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/df3f7e9bab01e3125c5fca71aa642f60.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision platformer, where you fly and collect stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can expect if you buy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >68+1 solo levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-5 hours of gameplay - every level takes 1-2 minutes if you don't die. But you will...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty, a fair difficulty curve was the goal, sometimes the game can be hard, sorry for that...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer shooting - a friendly fight with your people never hurts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer time trial - speedrunning the levels online (Trackmania style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All handmade graphics and sound - no AI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b39a9689858f616ea656752233a4fb21.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/b728943a5019cc982a50e921b2ad6cf4.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In single player mode the level difficulty increases slowly, giving plenty of time to enjoy and learn the challenging mechanics of flying between the platforms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/61879af6c44b0f50b6ed0f5a9230fc60.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=614 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/e4b7bee418574df4be6e45d4aef2cef0.mp4?t=1763058028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can go one step further and aim for speed! This game is especially designed for speedrunning, an homage to the style was deeply my intention. Playing against your own time, or against the Global Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.poster.avif?t=1763058028\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989960/extras/acf6c6df3fb7d30450400f82259720a6.webm?t=1763058028\" type=\"vi